        <!--
          Physical addressing for this server, as configured in bl_uds.c / bl_isotp.c:
            request  CAN ID : 0x7E0  (BL_ISOTP_ID_CMD)
            response CAN ID : 0x7E8  (BL_ISOTP_ID_REPLY)
            transport       : ISO 15765-2, single physical channel
            bus             : CAN, 250 kbit/s
            P2 server max   : 50 ms (iso14229 default)

          In a full ODX delivery these belong in a COMPARAM-REF block resolved against the
          ISO 15765-3 / 11898-2 COMPARAM-SPEC catalog. That catalog is not shipped with this
          single-file description, so the values are recorded here rather than as references
          that would not resolve. Add the COMPARAM-SPEC when packaging a complete PDX.
        -->

